# FNP


> Founded in 1994, FNP is India's largest and most trusted online gift store and gifting company, offering a wide range of special and personalized gifts to make every occasion special. With a legacy spanning over 30+ years, FNP has established itself as a household name, synonymous with quality, reliability, and exceptional customer service. Today, FNP delivers smiles across 70 countries, bringing people closer through thoughtful gifts, no matter where they are.
From birthdays and anniversaries to festivals like Diwali, Valentine's Day, Rakhi, and more, FNP has become the go-to destination for every celebration. The brand also offers an exclusive Luxe Gifts category, featuring premium hampers, designer bouquets, and high-end gifting options that redefine elegance and thoughtfulness.
FNP's commitment to excellence, innovative products, and customer-centric approach has earned it a loyal customer base and numerous accolades. Whether it's a special day or just a thoughtful gesture, FNP continues to make gifting personal, memorable, and effortless.


